  "content_html": "<p>Last week I got stuck in Newark for almost 48 hours (and had to rent a car for the final hours of my cross-country journey) in part because of the nationwide FAA ground stop. Yesterday United Airlines had a separate outage. A few days before that Microsoft Outlook went down for something like 24 hours. </p><p>On X, I warned that as a society we are focused on the wrong things:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aEo4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fccd4c1e4-fd2d-43d0-bfc8-0e1ba46eeab5_1295x1874.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aEo4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fccd4c1e4-fd2d-43d0-bfc8-0e1ba46eeab5_1295x1874.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aEo4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fccd4c1e4-fd2d-43d0-bfc8-0e1ba46eeab5_1295x1874.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aEo4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fccd4c1e4-fd2d-43d0-bfc8-0e1ba46eeab5_1295x1874.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aEo4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fccd4c1e4-fd2d-43d0-bfc8-0e1ba46eeab5_1295x1874.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aEo4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fccd4c1e4-fd2d-43d0-bfc8-0e1ba46eeab5_1