stack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>[Amtrak turned out to be a separate issue, but I left out WorkDay and the huge Microsoft Outlook fiasco from last week, so the larger point very much holds.]</p><p>And then two <em>more</em> things came soon after I posted that. </p><p>&#167;</p><p>The first was an attack that looks to be even more serious:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1371\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1371,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2059604,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/225343416?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oLH4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb75aa98a-130e-4a4e-9716-eca2e3e12459_1638x1542.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This tweet gives you a sense of how serious it is:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/ryanafournier/status/2122526834440974400?a=SyeKTPTQON0o_vC82cA&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;&#128680; BREAKING: MASSIVE cyberattack reportedly compromised websites belonging to 178 organizations!\\n\\nCNN. Fox News. BBC. Zoom. Salesforce. Major airlines. ALL affected.\\n\\nHackers injected malicious code through Optimizely, designed to STEAL credit card information, cryptocurrency,&#8230;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;RyanAFournier&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ryan Fournier&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1997136884561018880/EiGAD-gD_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-17T03:06:46.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:195,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:1264,&quot;like_count&quot;:3867,&quot;impression_count&quot;:333182,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>And the second is that Homeland Security Secretary Mullin finally broke ranks and acknowledged on FOX News that AI might well be part of many of these outages.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!c77-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F24f78575-fc16-4f41-9e7a-db44a